    "locked": false,
    "maintainer_can_modify": true,
    "title": "wallet: enforce max_tx_weight for preset inputs",
    "user": {
      "login": "gjija",
      "id": 4366099,
      "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjQzNjYwOTk=",
      "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4366099?v=4",
      "gravatar_id": "",
      "url": "https://api.github.com/users/gjija",
      "html_url": "https://github.com/gjija",
      "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/gjija/followers",
      "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/gjija/following%7B/other_user%7D",
      "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/gjija/gists%7B/gist_id%7D",
      "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/gjija/starred%7B/owner%7D%7B/repo%7D",
      "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/gjija/subscriptions",
      "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/gjija/orgs",
      "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/gjija/repos",
      "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/gjija/events%7B/privacy%7D",
      "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/gjija/received_events",
      "type": "User",
      "site_admin": false,
      "name": null,
      "patch_url": null
    },
    "body": "When preset inputs already cover the payment, `fundrawtransaction` can return a transaction exceeding the configured `max_tx_weight`. Coin selection returns early, and the final transaction check only enforces the general 400,000 WU ceiling.\n\nThis was reproduced with ten legacy inputs: a transaction with a signed weight of **6,168 WU** was accepted despite a **4,000 WU** limit, with both `add_inputs=false` and `add_inputs=true`.\n\nThis change makes the shared final check enforce the existing validated maximum, using actual weight for signed transactions and estimated signed weight for unsigned transactions.\n\nThe regression test covers both `add_inputs` settings. It verifies rejection at **4,000 WU** and successful funding and complete signing within an **8,000 WU** limit. The new regression failed before the fix and passed afterward.\n\nValidation on macOS arm64:\n\n- `wallet_fundrawtransaction.py` — passed\n- `wallet_send.py` — passed\n- `wallet_v3_txs.py` — passed\n- Live regtest reproduction with the fix — passed\n",
