      "message": "wallet: enforce max_tx_weight for preset inputs\n\nPreset inputs can cover the target without passing coin selection's maximum\nweight checks. The final guard used MAX_STANDARD_TX_WEIGHT rather than the\nvalidated configured maximum.\n\nUse the configured maximum in the final guard for signed weights and unsigned\nsigned-weight estimates. Add a regression covering both add_inputs settings\nwith a rejecting lower limit and an accepting higher limit.",
